[Windows] [wine] fix a test in util/stream, improve test diagnostic output

* Fix TestStdInReadTo test that incorrectly used TFileHandle::LinkTo to override the stdin stream (which does not work in Windows);
* Add new TFileHandle::Duplicate2Posix() method that is just dup2() on Unix and does necessary steps on Windows, use it in the above-mentioned test;
* Flush Cerr in Y_ASSERT/VERIFY so that the output does not disappear in case of tests running under ##wine##;
* Tune settings so that asserts in unit tests would not try to create message boxes in debug builds (message boxes do not work in our window-less ##wine## environment);

