SEARCH-10889: fix direct io for huge files

- move to size_t and 64 bit integers everywhere;
- explicitly call pread under linux, as TFile::RawPread doesn't support 64bit bytes count due to Win32;
- move SetDirectIO(true) up inside ReadFromFile method (seems there was a bug);
- loop first PreadSafe call in ReadFromFile (ReadFromFile tries to read as much as possible,  but single pread doesn't read more than 2G).

